  "name": "Narstone",
  "type": "consumable",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Usage</strong> material component of a spell</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"pf2-icon\">a</span> interact; <strong>Trigger</strong> You cast a spell from the school of conjuration</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When used as a material component (adding the material component to the spell if it doesn't already have it) for any conjuration spell, the Narstone heightens the spell rank by 1 up to the maximum level you can cast.</p>"
